{"4153250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EmbeRogue", "steam_appid": 4153250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>&quot;And then when you die you will come back again until the world also dies and nothing is left but ashes.&quot;</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/extras/1c248e9c88f3ea030d19baeaafdc54ae.poster.avif?t=1782208761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/extras/1c248e9c88f3ea030d19baeaafdc54ae.webm?t=1782208761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/extras/1c248e9c88f3ea030d19baeaafdc54ae.mp4?t=1782208761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Hibourogue comes <strong>EmbeRogue</strong>, a turn-based, grid-based and boom-based roguelike inspired by Brogue, Angband and ADOM.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A Real Roguelike:</u> turn-based, grid-based and boom-based tactical gameplay at your own pace but every move is final, each decision will shape your run with its consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Classless:</u> Each run you will find a different set of items, gear and spells to create your own build as you descend into the Pit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ego powers</u>: Magical and game-changing abilities can be found infused into weapons, armors, trinkets or rings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Secrets:</u> You can do something many times before you truly grasp what was done.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>You are the Emberbearer:</u> Channel inner flames through a branching power path that will give you the extra ability you need to prevent the full-force blaze from burning this world to ashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Permadeath:</u> It's the only permanence, only ashes are left anyway.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Pit is the first dungeon</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When heated, the Pit's flames will eat at everything, flattening regions to ashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a region is lost it becomes prey to a more sinister, darker corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ascend victorious from the Pit you should have the skill and spirit necessary to navigate a big overworld and take on the other 3 dungeons. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>&quot;And then when you die you will come back again until the world also dies and nothing is left but ashes.&quot;</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/extras/1c248e9c88f3ea030d19baeaafdc54ae.poster.avif?t=1782208761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/extras/1c248e9c88f3ea030d19baeaafdc54ae.webm?t=1782208761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/extras/1c248e9c88f3ea030d19baeaafdc54ae.mp4?t=1782208761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of Hibourogue comes <strong>EmbeRogue</strong>, a turn-based, grid-based and boom-based roguelike inspired by Brogue, Angband and ADOM.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A Real Roguelike:</u> turn-based, grid-based and boom-based tactical gameplay at your own pace but every move is final, each decision will shape your run with its consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Classless:</u> Each run you will find a different set of items, gear and spells to create your own build as you descend into the Pit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Ego powers</u>: Magical and game-changing abilities can be found infused into weapons, armors, trinkets or rings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Secrets:</u> You can do something many times before you truly grasp what was done.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>You are the Emberbearer:</u> Channel inner flames through a branching power path that will give you the extra ability you need to prevent the full-force blaze from burning this world to ashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Permadeath:</u> It's the only permanence, only ashes are left anyway.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Pit is the first dungeon</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When heated, the Pit's flames will eat at everything, flattening regions to ashes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a region is lost it becomes prey to a more sinister, darker corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ascend victorious from the Pit you should have the skill and spirit necessary to navigate a big overworld and take on the other 3 dungeons. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "EmbeRogue is a real roguelike: turn-based, grid-based and boom-based, where everything can burn. Make your escape or tame your inner flames to defeat the FireLords.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/bf77501bed7e1e5d76340108c5352b0f7d3dc3a7/header.jpg?t=1782208761", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153250/e4b5dd6d9e1bcd16d167858896ee2abf1d6eb578/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782208761", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/